## Agent Permissions

### Requirements

| ID | Requirement | Priority |
|----|-------------|----------|
| P1 | Agents can have visibility rules (who can see them) | Must |
| P2 | Agents can have messaging rules (who they can message) | Must |
| P3 | Agents can have acceptance rules (who they accept messages from) | Must |
| P4 | Role-based default permissions | Must |
| P5 | Per-agent permission overrides | Must |
| P6 | System-wide default permissions | Should |

### Design Decision: Hybrid Approach

Resolution order:
1. Start with system default permissions
2. If agent has a role, deep merge role permissions
3. Deep merge agent's `permissionOverrides`

Deep merge at field level within `canSee`, `canMessage`, `acceptsFrom`.

### Type Definitions

```typescript
// Permission rule types
type AgentVisibilityRule =
  | 'all' | 'hierarchy' | 'scoped' | 'direct'
  | { include: AgentId[] };

type ScopeVisibilityRule =
  | 'all' | 'member'
  | { include: ScopeId[] };

type StructureVisibilityRule = 'full' | 'local' | 'none';

type AgentMessagingRule =
  | 'all' | 'hierarchy' | 'scoped'
  | { include: AgentId[] };

type ScopeMessagingRule =
  | 'all' | 'member'
  | { include: ScopeId[] };

type AgentAcceptanceRule =
  | 'all' | 'hierarchy' | 'scoped'
  | { include: AgentId[] };

type ClientAcceptanceRule =
  | 'all' | 'none'
  | { include: ParticipantId[] };

type SystemAcceptanceRule =
  | 'all' | 'none'
  | { include: string[] };

// Main permissions interface
interface AgentPermissions {
  canSee?: {
    agents?: AgentVisibilityRule;
    scopes?: ScopeVisibilityRule;
    structure?: StructureVisibilityRule;
  };
  canMessage?: {
    agents?: AgentMessagingRule;
    scopes?: ScopeMessagingRule;
  };
  acceptsFrom?: {
    agents?: AgentAcceptanceRule;
    clients?: ClientAcceptanceRule;
    systems?: SystemAcceptanceRule;
  };
}

// Agent interface update
interface Agent {
  // ... existing fields ...
  permissionOverrides?: Partial<AgentPermissions>;
}

// System configuration
interface AgentPermissionConfig {
  defaultPermissions: AgentPermissions;
  rolePermissions: { [role: string]: AgentPermissions };
}
```

### Permission Resolution Function

```typescript
function resolveAgentPermissions(
  agent: Agent,
  config: AgentPermissionConfig
): AgentPermissions {
  let permissions = deepClone(config.defaultPermissions);

  if (agent.role && config.rolePermissions[agent.role]) {
    permissions = deepMerge(permissions, config.rolePermissions[agent.role]);
  }

  if (agent.permissionOverrides) {
    permissions = deepMerge(permissions, agent.permissionOverrides);
  }

  // Backwards compat: map visibility to canSee.agents
  if (agent.visibility && !agent.permissionOverrides?.canSee?.agents) {
    permissions.canSee = permissions.canSee ?? {};
    permissions.canSee.agents = mapVisibilityToRule(agent.visibility);
  }

  return permissions;
}
```

