## Comparison with Alternatives

| Aspect | Multiplexed ACP Streams | Gateway Agent | Native ACP |
|--------|------------------------|---------------|------------|
| **Client SDK** | MAP SDK (bundled ACP types) | ACP SDK (unchanged) | ACP SDK |
| **Network** | Single MAP connection | Two connections | Direct connection |
| **Multiple agents** | ✅ Multiple streams | ❌ Single gateway | ❌ One connection |
| **Observability** | ✅ Full MAP events | ❌ Limited | ❌ None |
| **Legacy clients** | ❌ Need migration | ✅ Works unchanged | ✅ Native |
| **Deployment** | Simple | Gateway process needed | Simple |
| **Debugging** | Single connection trace | Two connection traces | Single trace |
| **Federation** | ✅ Via MAP (future) | ✅ Via MAP | ❌ No |

